cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "TikTok Shop Vietnam commission rates by category, effective-dated"
abstract: >-
  TikTok Shop Vietnam's seller commission schedules effective 2026-05-09,
  2026-07-03 (Mall 2026-08-03) and 2026-10-20 (Mall), extracted from TikTok's
  own PDFs and compared category by category. 1,824 categories are comparable
  between May and July 2026: 1,366 increased, 404 were cut, 54 unchanged.
